  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0013","idiomatic","As the Tradition says: take Yao and Shun. When Yu, Ji, and Qi joined them in doing what was right, it was carried out; when Gun and Huan Dou sought to join them in wrongdoing, they were executed.","As the Tradition says: take Yao and Shun. When Yu, Ji, and Xie joined them in doing what was right, it was carried out; when Gun and Huan Dou sought to join them in wrongdoing, they were executed.","In 禹、稷、禼, 禼 is the sage-minister Xie (契), not Qi; replacing Qi with Xie corrects a real naming error without changing the rest of the sentence.","high","applied"],
    ["s0013","literal","The Tradition says: For example, with Yao and Shun, when Yu, Ji, and Qi joined them in doing good, it was carried out; when Gun and Huan Dou wished to join them in doing evil, they were executed.","The Tradition says: For example, with Yao and Shun, when Yu, Ji, and Xie joined them in doing good, it was carried out; when Gun and Huan Dou wished to join them in doing evil, they were executed.","The Chinese personal name 禼 in 禹、稷、禼 is Xie (契); Qi is a mistranslation, and the proposed literal replacement is accurate.","high","applied"]
  ],
